{% doc %}
  Hands out the next ticket number and advances the counter.

  Read then write, so two emails arriving in the same instant can take the
  same number. At support team volume that is a remote possibility with a
  cosmetic consequence, and platformOS has no atomic counter to borrow.
  Worth revisiting if this ever runs at a different scale.

  @param {object} settings - The settings record
{% enddoc %}
{% liquid
  assign number = settings.next_number | default: 1
  assign next = number | plus: 1

  graphql _ = 'modules/support/settings/set_next_number', id: settings.id, next_number: next
  return number
%}
